<p><strong>Location:&nbsp;<a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Nepean+Sportsplex/@45.3271152,-75.7472644,777m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x4cce07762014c8d1:0xcbe3e5300c2decc!8m2!3d45.3271152!4d-75.7446895!16s%2Fm%2F03d3q1s?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAyMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D" target="_blank">1701 Woodroffe Avenue</a></strong></p>
